{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>懲教署表示，石壁監獄今早（24日）7時47分，一名37歲在囚男子在日間活動室外，襲擊另一名43歲男囚友。在場懲教人員見狀立即制止施襲者，並召喚支援人員到場。</p><p>事件中，受襲者前額及面頰受傷，經院所醫生檢查及治理後，無需送院；施襲者則並無受傷。事件已轉交警方調查。署方指，兩名在囚人士分別於2024年及2016年因製造危險藥物罪及販運危險藥物罪而被判入獄。</p><figure><img alt=\"石壁監獄。（資料圖片/林若勤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2064521/org/31ee8c1d0f8835f59f17ac7e7bc6c7fe.JPG/DUvXjeX8LeRIIHQyscZuL58BFa_6-IDwzZD8aM2Q_Gg\"/><figcaption>石壁監獄。（資料圖片/林若勤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.511493+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:27:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:22.697706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:22.697706+00:00","content_hash":"7dc432d755be51a912b896cc24734fed40ddfbf28e8d86b4b2064a040be8948b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}